","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March has come in under 90% of normal in 43 of 75 years since 1951 on the middle of the Ellis County grids. On that same middle, February to March ran 41% of normal in 2025 and 11% in 2026, and March to April sat at 29% in 2026. Grid 22623 had its driest year in 1956 at 46% of normal.</p>"}
